**Recommendation: MAJOR REVISION.**

I read all 911 lines of v1 and cross-checked the requested interfaces. I found no FATAL obstruction to the proposed method. However, BL contains a false mass estimate, the parent acceptability calculation contains false root-conditioned inequalities, and the parent FAM argument does not establish its normalization with the cited definitions. O1 and O2 should remain open pending repairs.

The six supplied tests pass. They do not test these failures.

